{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9c15bbc52dd58b0b4e352d55d1ba5ec918d28284dd266fff009c7eba036d2e4d","ja":"クッキーの後始末","zh":"曲奇的善后工作","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"de741b8c8bc8bae78eb55c910cbb1eb369a1dfaca0ee24ac3d94e36c270e5581","ja":"ふたりのクッキー作りはさらに白熱して……","zh":"两人的曲奇制作变得更加热火朝天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6963a2e17b0b2f236f6999c05c5f6b38d09866255ba4292141957de322f05cf8","ja":"……よし、できた！　真っ赤な唐辛子クッキー！\nさっき奈緒が作ってた緑色のやつに対抗したくてさぁ。","zh":"……好，做好了！通红的辣椒饼干！\n因为我想跟刚才奈绪做的那个绿色的较较劲嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6b50a38650a981f81dea74b2548906d1cf3bb3a46a817db29a2c9bdc3ac7d20d","ja":"めーっちゃ抹茶入れた、人工芝風クッキーな！\n合わせたらなんやクリスマスっぽくなるやん♪","zh":"放了超——多抹茶的、人造草坪风曲奇！\n合在一起看，总觉得很有圣诞节的气氛呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c5af358bdcdd1afb3b5767be84b771fe2381c0d2ed58429cb9b8a3817850e536","ja":"次は……って、あれ！？\n小麦粉がもう、ほとんど残ってない！？","zh":"接下来是……咦，等等！？\n面粉已经几乎没剩多少了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"817500ea771759cb70814ad4f9d45b1ab348e02ed3bc70ee9ed244fdeab2be8f","ja":"うわっ、ホンマや！　没頭しすぎたわ！\nほな、作るのは終わりにしてラッピングを……。","zh":"哇，真的耶！太投入了！\n那就先做到这里，开始包装……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"dc8d8ac9bea9cb233d7be7faad8f29a36204428ca35a8936d309a7db473275e2","ja":"って、私らクッキー作りすぎちゃう！？\nこれ、アニキたちに配ってもかなり余ってまうで！？","zh":"话说，我们是不是做太多曲奇了！？\n这个就算分给我哥他们，也还会剩下一大堆吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d67853f9c31795caa54f2a110b60dee843ab7641979a2e2ea12b40a678483fab","ja":"うわ、どうしよ～！\n劇場のみんなにも配れば、なんとかなるかな……？","zh":"哇，怎么办啊～！\n要是也分给剧场的大家，能不能解决呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4c16322881d493170fe09ddfe2abfc00c44908b4503d97276efb68c3003e28e9","ja":"どうやろ……それに、変わり種クッキーは、\nみんな食べてくれるやろか？","zh":"会怎样呢……而且，稀奇古怪口味的饼干，\n大家真的会吃吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"05eb29b3e72b89327f370bbdefc9bbb456b361bc42c80cae97c0d2b4a1ea1cf6","ja":"ほら、抹茶好きな人はいるし……。\nいやでも、激辛クッキーはさすがに厳しいよな……。","zh":"你看，也是有喜欢抹茶的人的嘛……\n不过，特辣曲奇怎么想都还是太勉强了吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"38fac1dc5ae76ff82bbebd3aac1a952e804404703a0f882862a35052a8d006f1","ja":"とりあえず、正直に味のこと言うしかないな。\nで、それでも味見したいって人に食べてもらおうぜ！","zh":"先老老实实跟他们说味道如何吧。\n然后，让即使这样也想尝尝看的人吃吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5a3acef0b9b2758dceff904014441b10b134a1a2956dfac966dc95f5f8252019","ja":"そやな！　あとは……あ、ロシアンルーレット方式で\n盛り上がってもらうのはどうや！？","zh":"对啊！还有就是……啊，用俄罗斯轮盘赌的方式\n让他们热闹起来怎么样！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a19a9711370066160056291544d11d7fbde6a67adef9c23096f2299ef891accf","ja":"当たりはずれもあるけど、それでよかったら\nみんな一斉に食べてみて～って感じで！","zh":"虽然会有好有坏，但要是不介意的话，\n大家就一起尝尝看吧～差不多这种感觉！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d138772b4f5714f7a4a462d121da7a75924e973e29b7812167abd357558e97a2","ja":"いいな！　でも、それでも残ったら……\nオレたちが気合いで食べるしかないか……。","zh":"真不错！不过，要是那样还剩下的话……\n就只能靠我们硬撑着吃掉了吗……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1596.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"707ffcd08ac0763a89cf3fd483ecf16799328ab67d41c5abf5dc96dc47e94afb","ja":"うう……せめて食べきれる量になるように、\nみんなにおススメしよ！","zh":"呜呜……为了能剩下刚好能吃完的分量，\n去推荐给其他人吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
